-- title: Central API unreachable
-- severity: High
-- url: {central_url}/api/method/ping
-- expected_text: pong
-- timeout: 10
-- pending_for: 180
-- resolve_after: 300
-- runbook_url: https://github.com/frappe/central/blob/develop/beacon/runbooks/central-unreachable.md
-- Beacon calls the Central API from outside. The dashboard, the CLI and Pilot use it. Desk sets the Regions to the Central Telemetry Region.
